  "title": "Ian&#39;s Potato-Vegetable Soup",
  "description": "Start with potatoes, carrots, onions, and celery, and then you decide what other vegetables go in to the pot. Cream of celery soup and parsley are added once the vegetables are tender.",
  "authors": [
    "Ian Riesterer"
  ],
